        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating multiple Python files for a batch speech-to-text service integration using Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API. The files are categorized into same-scenario, helper, and later-step files. Each scored implementation file must use the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API and make it identifiable in the code. The helper files will provide local configuration and utilities. The later-step files will handle additional tasks like translation, moderation, summarization, and embedding. </thinking>\n",
